# Product lock

- MacBook-only system-wide EQ. No iPhone, no sync product, no PWA.
- Auto = Measure (mic, user-selectable) OR Narrow (persist per speaker until Retry).
- Custom = pro console with easy progressive disclosure.
- Core Audio process taps; no BlackHole GPL embed.
- Personal use; free signing only — no $99 assumptions.
- World-class bar; no me-too EQ fluff in copy.
- Full conventions: `AGENTS.md`. Autonomous ship: `autonomous-gap-fix` skill only.
